{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ee4397f0fbed0427a6a66492be5ab078a85a2c3d3b6cdb8eccccd89acf4d81d0",
      "text": "Here you go~. Feanie made them\nherself~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cbf2fd246ea98b5b83547c2dcccc5580f40273908b82dfee1ffc5b2edbc4d930",
      "text": "Mm! Delicious, Feanie. So this is a\nsweet from your hometown.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "14": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3559ca8da60aba373f214ca2cff36ee5b6a5764a7d216ecbedd80034bf15b78c",
      "text": "They're called Pretzen~. Papa\ntaught me how to make them a long\ntime ago.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "17": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:909fe339aeb24cc50699281a767766110868f9da91c515e98c8daac9df1a9d3e",
      "text": "So at Valentine's Fest, you can give\nsweets to someone you like, even if\nit's not love~? Feanie didn't know~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "20": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0ab84fdc99dd0bebd361f6afa6844af8c9b93ddd04500a0c22bd7a41d55801e3",
      "text": "So Feanie wants to make lots and\nlots to give away~. Feanie has so\nmany people to love now~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "25": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6efb5a83195655d3f163205361065c71946352a8b4c0186b42db23858aec2894",
      "text": "I see... Everyone will be happy. If\nyou make more, can I help?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "29": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8d1df111578fd7f2606197740fe9d8f2f4069aac6bfc5b2c7b37d67e8176476a",
      "text": "Really~? Thank you~ ♪",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "37": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d4ca1563ffa94b7cb01a97c1e33443f839b6572d78b1c6820bce22e810fccb96",
      "text": "Happy Valentine's~. Please accept\nFeanie's love and thanks~ ♪",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "40": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a3299b8005d9951b807639395a0f690d94b9e83d775905fbcabd728ded25dc8e",
      "text": "Happy Valentine's, Feanie. Guys can\ngive gifts too, right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "43": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6fc76fe6c17b6056778f98b142ea2f5061b79ab591ebe83177484205ffcaa233",
      "text": "Wowie~... Thank you~! Feanie got\neveryone's love~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "46": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0f184b1f8173c2d2ce022d09d98769697bd8612564db4c1ab90425432afcfaf5",
      "text": "Man, it's kind of touching... Like\nhow a dad feels getting a present\nfrom his daughter, maybe?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "48": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bddbfc4e30d36538a008ce5f5a039ab2d2876bf22427d8f1dd2388b893b43ba3",
      "text": "S-someday you can definitely give\none to Feanie's dad too! He'll\nsurely be happier than we are...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "51": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:76559c0357f0a68f6d95098671bec70c7d70147fe67da5eb29e87563746aed39",
      "text": "It's okay~. Feanie believes that\ntoo~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "54": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:012ea73a79cd79e81443ea1b60e9f078c01b7b4ebb5f186c589e3b111c36655a",
      "text": "I hope Papa will be happy~. I hope\nI can meet him soon~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "57": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e29c4e116928544793aa2d04156c813598f57799af95693085146b78bc3e2f9f",
      "text": "...Say, that traveler over there is\nlooking for long-lost family too.\nLots of folks like that, huh...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "60": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9757b1d9e0a493b55c8d254cd78a2d75feb686f4001b4b8c61a73021b7d861ef",
      "text": "...Happy Valentine's. May I meet\nthe people I love~...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "64": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a16f5c9045c1a9bcb991c4f428b4d222b675ff13c8ee25aeca83a0d41ae1c563",
      "text": "...Hm... The smell of Pretzen...?\nWhy—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "67": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3605f9c6184e9a28d80401170707bf5b4a87e75379e508557cf16c0257adc617",
      "text": "...Fee-Fee...? Fee-Fee, is that\nyou...!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "69": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:67b11b35cd6029f650d3f80c459473f105b8ad711b998639bae3cd4710571507",
      "text": "Papa, it's Papa! Do you recognize\nme? I've, I've always, always—!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "72": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:546f54f6120cb19629f25e8f9677ab0ddb95e9859207388630c39a537062e3ea",
      "text": "...Papa~...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "75": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:df2e31ee364fb6de07717baff081014746a19ab60fe2134401bac161cb496e9b",
      "text": "I missed you so much~...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "79": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:988d9e2f51c425c3a51caf73634d245c2d98c62f63e3eb963b97c070b502067a",
      "text": "Papa~. Stop crying~. Your eyes are\nall red~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "81": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f865bdc01b43690b12f08c24a80cee36188c33e99307743984b715b8470b04f0",
      "text": "Ugh... Sorry, Fee-Fee... It still\nfeels like a dream... Uuuuu~...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "84": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f99fb12d57e876ba54e2be7c6ccb5b214ece26020a30eddfafa2dd1ddea6a360",
      "text": "Geez~. Papa is hopeless without\nFeanie~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "87": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6dcb2013554b1783e39bd143c58a33dafdaacd1ba48540cc66af68a7367e6f91",
      "text": "...I'm truly sorry, Fee-Fee. We\nstill haven't found Mama, and I\nleft you all alone...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "89": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e04db8c0444ff962905f4c1e44e68db65151022acb1f4dc981c9cdcdddb7191b",
      "text": "You must have had such a hard time—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "92": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ad390e8480ad9d8d21718c91abce7f6d72ae3b6943790d848ff785e760f9a6da",
      "text": "No~. It wasn't only hard, you know?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "95": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c44209de30efdf063b99b1ea96c85f01b1334324bc021e3f8204e334c6720b26",
      "text": "Feanie met wonderful people~.\nSometimes Feanie didn't get her own\nfeelings and felt all foggy, but...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "98": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5f2cbb35062db9af12b9a36f68431939322e5a65af7a712dff727d47b6367983",
      "text": "Everybody taught me~. And then my\nlove and thank-yous grew and\ngrew...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "101": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:237c9da905ccbab4a1321454620d592ce8aeb86f4be765a06459c10ab49da89d",
      "text": "So, Papa, Feanie knows what she\nwants to say~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "105": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dad28a9509c2a9bea3661f0f9eb80047fc74ed704226961d7b8274275cea7c8d",
      "text": "—Feanie always wanted to see you. Papa\nand Mama both. You're forever special,\nand Feanie loves you sooo much~...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "108": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:79fec127455e49cacdd983fc1c81190c8ad0e5af4be417ef4f04a236a58109ca",
      "text": "...Fee-Fee... You've grown into\nsuch a wonderful girl...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "111": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8ba3472f17523e0cd3beb4476b7eff8b7e9779fc99af6430118330b874954f19",
      "text": "Yeah~! Feanie even helps people\nwith her dream power~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "114": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3ccab0889089256865680ab3b788b7e42c4dfd25dcf79634ff05ee64588800bf",
      "text": "Yes, yes, yes...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "116": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:692c3df113af7e0097d13864810fb44041e7f8ea10126ac8b600cae361371110",
      "text": "Lately~, Feanie's also studying\nabout love~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "119": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f282b30228bc4f5007a56d36a99091e2772a1dac9175d04650801d7951c5ed7a",
      "text": "H... Hm...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "122": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:445d14f8a34cfc29ac1d518d8fc8b23acb7af4f23560a6346d0c8f51e6895adb",
      "text": "Love has so many shapes, you know~?\nFeanie was surprised~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "125": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2cafee6fbbb0c844cb10327cd59d77ab638e38b4b70536cfd856890a36dcdc98",
      "text": "L-l-l-love!? D-d-don't tell me\nFee-Fee has a sweetheart!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "128": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2f88c8583a58982682b74f002a536c965bf47462471ddc1373447a1513aee210",
      "text": "Nope~. Feanie hasn't figured out\nher shape of love yet~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "132": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2dd505c7d8152bea24ee9598cc1da8dd3f3071e13a279c92463e7379b838dcf5",
      "text": "...Hey, hey, Papa. What kind of\nlove did you and Mama have~?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "135": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:25341f08a9aa9389d1f7f82f30dab27940a695a6146c453380f6f2d80969b760",
      "text": "W-what's this all of a sudden!? I\ndon't remember something from so\nlong ago...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "139": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4837cc83608db91092f0a91edff4abd13b40748b32bf7f7a3e4aa657b92bef2a",
      "text": "Liar~. You told me dozens of times\nabout your anniversary with Mama\nand the day Feanie was born~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "142": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7ea89f1913dc6809d1e5c4a418fff40663d27e416ec3a223946e55d629b05880",
      "text": "Feanie wants to know more~. About\nPapa and Mama~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "145": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f5739e4711a753d3bb5ae16d5dacd8a708857a828186a3ba0ec63b1137c7ab77",
      "text": "...Yeah... You're right. Then,\nshould I start from the first time\nI met your mother!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "153": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:93117d7119d7e5f856e349927446abd82781e9ab0ca5f70d1a4fbc474e69b4e0",
      "text": "I'm glad you were reunited with\nyour father...! I'm so happy for\nyou! ★",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "157": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:085dd182d8c4c4b953c3c455520c08a76a3dd45f7f58a955ea4dcfede05448b3",
      "text": "Thank you, Lilie~! From now on,\nFeanie will look for Mama with\nPapa~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "160": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b26d7e337192e64250368644d2696bb511f689a65cf4c128d73bb664ceb939e5",
      "text": "Feanie will be asking for lots of\nhelp again~... Is that okay~?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "164": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1f3555e4e08999bd1dce0f51417b63b4ca4c92804c6ffe031ec347bc8d8a5053",
      "text": "Of course. We will cooperate any\ntime.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "168": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:43d4f3fcc1535359eecbfc70672fe50e431380f67b1c09bd36e866c221932503",
      "text": "Thank you, Light~. Thank you,\neverybody~! Please take care of\nus~!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "171": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:eb7a6445d02989bbd67e3fa6936f760eda3acdfeb07f67c045038984d461694d",
      "text": "If I confess, I might get turned\ndown... So maybe stay like this...\nBut still— Uuuu, what do I do...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "174": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:be753f9eaf512dd3ff0dcd03408d2d8a961ea1a38b4803ea613604ba95f06718",
      "text": "Trouble with love~? If you'd like,\nFeanie can listen~?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "177": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6528fb4cb68fd23f37466f5bf71edd97ac09da154edebd832d88cb729b040c7c",
      "text": "Dreams and love, Feanie's here to\nhelp~. Leave it to Feanie~ ♪",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
